.TH SDL_GetWindowProgressState 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetWindowProgressState \- Get the state of the progress bar for the given window’s taskbar icon.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_ProgressState SDL_GetWindowProgressState(SDL_Window *window);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I window
the window to get the current progress state from\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the progress state, or
.BR SDL_PROGRESS_STATE_INVALID
on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

